{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A desktop idle birdwatching simulator where you never need to worry about feeding or raising birds. Simply place it under your desktop, and adorable birds will flock to you. Unlock countless unique species, discover diverse natural habitats, and immerse yourself in the heartwarming joy of observing, photographing, and creating your own birding books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938920/extras/e2f2dd324bd67ad1e2db3851558757b1.avif?t=1771808418\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938920/extras/0b3695dbce406e3187c06abbd943a9ff.avif?t=1771808418\" width=616 height=93 /></span>\u200c</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaving the game running generates increasing coins. Collect them anytime to buy bird feed and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938920/extras/0806e0dcb821fc7774eb873657904a0e.poster.avif?t=1771808418\" width=1600 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938920/extras/0806e0dcb821fc7774eb873657904a0e.webm?t=1771808418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938920/extras/0806e0dcb821fc7774eb873657904a0e.mp4?t=1771808418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938920/extras/45eacc4ed2a880e5dbdfb32ffd2e0b0b.avif?t=1771808418\" width=616 height=93 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200c<br>S